nt }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}(12xy-4{x}^{2}y+4x{y}^{2})\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[6x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x{y}^{3}]}_{y=0}^{y=1}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(6x-2{x}^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x)-0\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{22}{3}x-2{x}^{2})\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{22}{3}x-2{x}^{2})\\,dx & ={[\\frac{11}{3}{x}^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{3}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =(\\frac{11}{3}-\\frac{2}{3})-0 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/state.json" "file_sha256" "5a0c8097a784b55c27406d8ffdb95f891f6b2c43f5ad3aff3c0357fb22ab15f0" "basis" 2019 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-161516" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "986d45b074d202621525e2f4d579743e1ed7e1f54a93934fb99f31c5b0e63474" "basis" 2019 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-161516" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/state.json" "file_sha256" "5a0c8097a784b55c27406d8ffdb95f891f6b2c43f5ad3aff3c0357fb22ab15f0" "basis" 2019 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-161516" "field" "selection" "attri